<h1>Magazine of Fantasy & Science Fiction</h1>

<i>The Magazine of Fantasy and Science Fiction</i> has been published
since 1949, although issue #1 was titled <i>The Magazine of Fantasy</i>.
They also have a
<a href="http://www.enews.com:80/magazines/fsf/">web page</a>.
A one year subscription (11 issues) is currently $22.97. Write:
<pre>
    Fantasy & Science Fiction
    143 Cream Hill Rd.
    West Cornwall, CT 06796-9975
</pre>
<p>
Thanks to Edwin M. Schaefer for the use of his collection in
reconstructing this data.  Most of the information from 1974 thru
1994 was supplied by 
(<a href="mailto:redacted@redacted.com">Michael J. Cross</a>).
Holes in the 1974-1994 era were filled by the Schaefer collection,
which was the primary source for 1965-1973 data.
The 1949-1951,1953, 1954(Feb-Oct,Dec), 1955(Jan-Mar,May-Jun,Aug-Oct,Dec),
1956(Jan,Mar-Oct,Dec), 1957(Jan-Aug, Oct-Dec), 1958-1959,
1960(Jan,Mar,May-Dec), 1961(Jan-Feb, Apr-May, Jul-Dec), 1962(Jan-Jun,Aug,Nov-Dec),
1963(Jan-Nov) data was supplied by 
(<a href="mailto:redacted@redacted.com">David Stovall</a>).
The anchors below lead to specific issues of F&SF; they
currently list works of fiction, and the cover artist.
